3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:05,530
Don't leave again

4
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:09,840
It's so small that you'll die if you stay here.

5
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:14,680
you can't stay

6
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,280
Let's go with sister

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:19,480
Xiao Fan and Xiao Su are also going, just treat it as a tourist trip

8
