25
00:00:59,130 --> 00:01:00,090
Xiaosu Xiaofan

26
00:01:00,090 --> 00:01:01,330
You all can drive

27
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:03,450
You two drive the small car I usually drive.

28
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:05,010
Xiaoxiao, ride in the SUV with me

29
00:01:05,010 --> 00:01:11,650
It just so happens that my daughter clings to her

30
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:13,330
